// Per-occurrence lyric verses: `[1. …] [2. …]` inside a lyric section give the
// section a different verse each time it is sung. Form A |: ~B :| A "A2": the
// first A sings verse 1, the A2 reprise sings verse 2 — not a repeat of verse 1.
title "verse per occurrence"
octave absolute
time 4/4
key c major
part melody { clef treble
  section A { c'4 d' e' d' | c'4 e' g'2 | }
  section B { g'4 g' g' g' | }
}
lyrics words {
  section A {
    [1. Twin- kle twin- kle | lit- tle star |]
    [2. How I won- der | what you are |]
  }
}
form main { A |: ~B :| A "A2" }
score main { staff melody with lyrics words }
